cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FusionQC: multimodal defect detection for injection moulding"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/crazysandy1/injection-moulding-fusion-qc"
abstract: >-
  A multimodal deep-learning system that fuses thermal images, process-curve
  time series, tabular machine data and warpage images with a cross-modal
  transformer to predict injection-moulding defects, with domain-adversarial
  training, explainability, counterfactual setpoint recommendations and drift
  monitoring.
keywords:
  - multimodal learning
  - injection moulding
  - quality control
  - transformer
  - domain adversarial training
